# Model card for saspeech (medium)

* Language: he_IL (Hebrew, Israel)
* Speakers: 1
* Quality: medium
* Samplerate: 22,050Hz

## Dataset

* URL: https://www.openslr.org/134 (gold standard)
* License: See dataset URL

## Training

Finetuned from the rdh base model (medium quality; nl_BE, one Flemish speaker, CC0), with MRD and SDP.

Default inference settings are noise_scale 0.5 and noise_w 0.333.

Requires Piper 1.6.0 or higher (Hebrew phonemizer).
